[IQ Generator Preset]
# Lesson 7: carrier frequency offset.
# Open the Constellation tab and choose the matched-filter view. A 5 Hz offset spins the constellation about five times during the 1 s signal, so the four QPSK points smear into a ring. This is why receivers need carrier recovery. Set CFO to 0 to compare, or try 0.5 Hz to see a partial arc.
